and do all these weird things that domestic dogs will do.

263
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,870
He doesn't really act like a dog.

264
00:11:01,870 --> 00:11:03,200
He doesn't look like a dog.

265
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,840
And he doesn't fit into most people's...

266
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:07,410
normal idea of a dog's type of life.

267
00:11:08,170 --> 00:11:11,110
So not only is our purpose to rescue the animals that we can,

268
00:11:11,110 --> 00:11:13,180
but our other purpose is to educate people...

269
00:11:13,180 --> 00:11:15,080
