270
00:11:16,550 --> 00:11:21,250
(The sanctuary is working to educate people about wolfdogs.)

271
00:11:21,250 --> 00:11:23,250
They seem to be really enjoying that.

272
00:11:24,290 --> 00:11:26,990
We're going to go ahead and do that treat round.

273
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:29,830
Which means, you get to toss some treats to these guys.

274
00:11:30,490 --> 00:11:31,630
I'm scared.

275
00:11:31,630 --> 00:11:33,860
Don't you think it'll be scary if they come close?

276
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:34,870
They're so big.

277
00:11:34,870 --> 00:11:36,430
