- They won't come so close.

278
00:11:36,430 --> 00:11:37,470
Here they come.

279
00:11:37,470 --> 00:11:38,600
They're so pretty.

280
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,840
They must know when it's time to eat.

281
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:42,410
I guess they know there's food when they hear people.

282
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:44,610
(I heard there were snacks here?)

283
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:47,010
Now, the biggest thing is to make sure...

284
00:11:47,010 --> 00:11:49,480
