- Oh, you're scared.

303
00:12:30,620 --> 00:12:31,890
So cute.

304
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:33,890
- So cute.
- They look so cool.

305
00:12:34,290 --> 00:12:35,660
- Bye.
- Oh, gosh.

306
00:12:36,690 --> 00:12:38,430
Put your guards down, you fools.

307
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,930
I hope they live good lives.

308
00:12:42,430 --> 00:12:44,700
We're going to see some of the low-contents.

309
00:12:45,470 --> 00:12:49,810
