313
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:58,020
So cute! They're so cute!

314
00:12:58,780 --> 00:12:59,820
Oh, my. So handsome.

315
00:13:00,820 --> 00:13:02,590
These are definitely friendly...

316
00:13:02,590 --> 00:13:03,820
