344
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:07,920
This must be the most gentle one.

345
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:10,220
So beautiful.

346
00:14:10,220 --> 00:14:12,620
They are, yes. So, these, again,

347
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:14,730
