348
00:14:14,730 --> 00:14:17,330
Which means they are less than 50 percent.

349
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:19,600
So they're more dog than wolf.

350
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,700
- I see. That's why.
- I see.

351
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,740
They can be close to humans.

352
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:27,470
(We present to you our sanctuary's prettiest wolfdogs.)

353
00:14:27,470 --> 00:14:31,310
All right. So, this here is Yarrow, the troublemaker, as I said.

354
00:14:32,010 --> 00:14:33,010
Hi, bud.

355
00:14:33,110 --> 00:14:34,950
(Yarrow, the super affectionate troublemaker)

356
00:14:34,950 --> 00:14:37,880
I know. Thank you. What a good man.

357
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:39,650
Yes. Good boy.

358
00:14:39,650 --> 00:14:41,050
So cute.

359
00:14:41,050 --> 00:14:42,920
He's so happy.

360
00:14:43,350 --> 00:14:44,660
This one is Ash.

361
00:14:44,660 --> 00:14:46,090
(Ash, 2 years old)

362
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:47,390
Look at him.

363
00:14:47,390 --> 00:14:51,900
(Ash is full of curiosity.)

364
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:55,900
(Willow, 2 years old, Sage, 2 years old)

365
00:14:57,370 --> 00:14:59,470
- Oh, they went right up.
- Oh, my. Good job.

366
00:15:03,270 --> 00:15:04,410
So pretty.

367
00:15:04,810 --> 00:15:05,910
They're sitting.

368
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,140
- They're dogs.
- So cute.

369
00:15:07,140 --> 00:15:10,680
(They're playing freely with their guards down.)

370
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:17,050
(They're really mischievous puppies.)

371
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:18,890
So, they're so cute.

372
00:15:21,190 --> 00:15:23,590
Just watching them is healing.

373
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:25,630
Goodness.

374
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:32,240
(A restful place for both wolfdogs and humans)

375
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,170
That one is really like a puppy.

376
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:40,080
So you can see they're quite a bit different from the high-contents.

377
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,850
A lot of people think, "Well, maybe I get..."

378
00:15:41,850 --> 00:15:43,610
"a low-content and put it in my home."

379
00:15:43,610 --> 00:15:46,720
But unfortunately, they still don't work out very well.

380
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:49,690
They're still a very independent animal.

381
00:15:49,690 --> 00:15:52,190
And they still think, "How does this benefit me?"

382
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:53,860
Yarrow.

383
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:55,860
And I want him to come over.

384
00:15:55,860 --> 00:16:00,100
Then they will trade for a high enough value item.

385
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:01,670
For something they do want.

386
00:16:02,530 --> 00:16:04,340
As a dog, they care about you.

387
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:06,800
A wolfdog cares about themselves.

388
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:11,440
They're basically just a novelty-type animal...

389
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:13,840
