390
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:16,150
And then they end up getting in over their heads.

391
00:16:16,150 --> 00:16:18,250
And then they have to call a sanctuary like ours.

392
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:22,720
That's why people might easily...

393
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:25,590
give up raising wolfdogs, right?

394
00:16:25,590 --> 00:16:26,920
- Yes.
- They don't listen to them.

395
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,260
Yes, exactly.

396
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:29,960
- But you still can't abandon them.
- What?

397
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,230
You still shouldn't give them up.

398
00:16:31,230 --> 00:16:32,260
Seriously.

399
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:36,770
(Now, they're spending their days in a safe haven.)

400
00:16:38,770 --> 00:16:40,840
I'm glad to see that they're happy.

401
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:45,510
So, are you guys interested in doing another treat round with these guys?

402
00:16:45,510 --> 00:16:47,440
- Feeding some treats to them?
- Yes, please.

403
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:49,950
So, this treat round is going to be very different, though.

404
00:16:49,950 --> 00:16:53,550
Because these guys will come up and eat the treat out of your hand.

405
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:56,850
So, with them, all you do is close those treats in a fist...

406
00:16:56,850 --> 00:17:00,220
and hold your fist up to your chest like this. Perfect. Just like that.

407
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:02,630
And then, when they're calm, you take one treat at a time...

408
00:17:02,630 --> 00:17:04,190
and feed it out with an open palm.

409
00:17:04,190 --> 00:17:05,200
That way, they can take it...

410
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,430
- right out of your hand.
- Right.

411
00:17:06,430 --> 00:17:08,900
Please don't wave the treats around to get them to look a certain way.

412
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:09,970
That's just teasing them.

413
00:17:09,970 --> 00:17:12,540
And then, please don't toss the treats to these guys.

414
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,240
Okay.

415
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,240
Throw them far out. They shouldn't get close.

416
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:19,310
Oh, here they come.

417
00:17:19,310 --> 00:17:20,940
(Low-content wolfdogs eat treats out of your hand.)

418
00:17:20,940 --> 00:17:22,050
Here you go.

419
00:17:22,310 --> 00:17:23,310
One at a time.

420
00:17:23,310 --> 00:17:24,380
- Hold on.
- You can take it one at a time...

421
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:25,450
- Hold on.
- and feed them.

422
00:17:26,050 --> 00:17:27,120
Here you go.

423
00:17:28,290 --> 00:17:29,390
(Me too, please.)

424
00:17:31,420 --> 00:17:35,260
But since they're so big, they are a bit intimidating.

425
00:17:35,460 --> 00:17:36,560
All gone.

426
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:37,830
- Look at them eating.
- There you go.

427
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:39,500
There you go.

428
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:41,400
(Is there any more?)

429
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:43,870
Hey, Sage. Come.

430
00:17:44,170 --> 00:17:45,170
Sage.

431
00:17:45,570 --> 00:17:47,570
- Good girl.
- No.

432
00:17:47,570 --> 00:17:48,740
Good girl.

433
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,640
- Good girl.
- Good boys.

434
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:53,340
- There you go.
- So pretty.

435
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:00,620
- Good boy.
- Off-leash is the only way...

436
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:02,520
- they'll let it happen.
- Good boy.

437
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:04,490
- Hi.
- Come here.

438
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:06,960
- Hi.
- So big.

439
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:10,360
(With their guards down, they're just friendly puppies.)

440
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,100
Oh, it's itchy.

441
00:18:12,530 --> 00:18:14,000
- Is your neck itchy?
- He must be...

442
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,370
- Are you happy?
- the highest rank?

443
00:18:15,630 --> 00:18:17,800
- Is it nice?
- He's just the most social.

444
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:20,170
- Hi.
- He likes to come close.

445
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:25,040
(Happy with Ju Bin's affection, they give her a friendly greeting.)

446
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,810
Oh, gosh. Okay.

447
00:18:28,850 --> 00:18:29,910
They must like her.

448
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:36,390
So cute. They must know I like them.

449
00:18:37,150 --> 00:18:39,790
- So pretty.
- Ju Bin is good with them.

450
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:42,560
They were really like puppies.

451
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:43,990
They were cool.

452
00:18:44,630 --> 00:18:46,530
They were fascinating too. And cute.

453
00:18:46,530 --> 00:18:48,730
They like people so much,

454
00:18:48,730 --> 00:18:52,240
