455
00:18:55,170 --> 00:18:56,470
It's quite big.

456
00:18:57,810 --> 00:19:00,380
Oh, my. They're all the way over there.

457
00:19:00,610 --> 00:19:02,310
- Oh, my.
- This place is huge.

458
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:03,580
