459
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:05,050
What a great environment.

460
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:07,320
They're spread out back there.

461
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,050
- So nice.
- All the way there.

462
00:19:09,050 --> 00:19:11,820
I like that it's so big that it's hard to spot them.

463
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:16,760
I thought that it would be nice if we could have such a place...

464
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:18,260
