465
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:19,860
It was a meaningful experience.

466
00:19:20,730 --> 00:19:21,970
I loved it.

467
00:19:23,470 --> 00:19:26,440
But it kind of goes to show that at the end of the day...

468
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:31,010
