517
00:21:47,040 --> 00:21:48,280
Beautiful!

518
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:50,180
- Yes. Welcome.
- Yes.

519
00:21:50,180 --> 00:21:51,480
Welcome.

520
00:21:51,620 --> 00:21:53,050
Welcome to my bar.

521
00:21:54,950 --> 00:21:57,950
Okay. We're going to get the drinks going.

